 * The data type representing {@code geography} type values. Geography represents geodetic
 * (spherical) spatial data qualified by a Spatial Reference System Identifier (SRID) and a geodetic
 * calculation algorithm.
 *
 * <p>Two {@link GeographyType} instances are equal if and only if they have the same SRID and
